# Baseline v1.19 — lane A of three. See campaigns/baseline_v1_19_README.md.
#
# One run per doctrine scenario, ALL at the same commit, ALL on the shipped
# reward defaults (no --reward overrides anywhere in this campaign — that is
# the point: the defaults are the baseline), ALL on seed 12.
#
# Lane A leads with the long pole: platoon is 16 agents and ~2h on its own.
platoon_v6            --scenario platoon --total-steps 3000000 --seed 12
# fireteam_v9 was pulled OUT of this lane and launched standalone at 10:20: a
# neighbouring project's sweep took ~6 of the box's 10 cores, platoon's ETA went
# 2h26m -> 4h41m, and fireteam was the only job whose completion depended on the
# long pole rather than on the work itself. train.sh refuses a duplicate launch,
# so this line surviving in the file is a no-op, not a second run.
fireteam_v9           --scenario fireteam --total-steps 3500000 --seed 12
